<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Wahebulania</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wahe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wahebulania</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kihitabu kya Wahebulania</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kihitabu kya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wahebulania</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Wahebulania ni kihitabu kya kutaya moyu kulangiha vila Yesu katimilisa amonga gha ulota wa Lilaghano lya dahile, na hali liyandikwa handa hotuba. Kukihitabu haki kuvili na mighalu ipiti isitini ku Lilaghano yeni kulangiha lipala lipala vila Yesu katimilisa ulota na mahengu gha mtambika Mkulu wa Kiyahudi. Kukovekelana na hali kihitabu kila kimaanisa kuwataya moyu wakwinila wa Kiyahudi. Kihitabu kya Wahebulania kingulangiha vila Yesu katimilisa selia ili watambika wakotoho kuyendelela kuhumisa litambiku lya kulungusa kangi. Yesu awelili litambiku lya sambi syogha, ikagholeka lihanja limonga kwaikiva gha machuwa hyogha. Wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito wenikulikala machuwa hagha na weni wanguwesa kutaywa moyu kupitila ili wayendeleli kumkovekela Yesu Kilisito mweni angutuwesesa tuyendeleli kumkwinila Sapanga na hilahila tuyendeleli kumkwinila mweni 12:2.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwahela mweni kumanya yiwa ghani kayandika kihitabu kya Wahebulania, ila wasoma wangulonga yiwa anguwesa kuwela Mndumindumi Paulo au Lukasi au Balinaba ndiwa mweni kuyandika kihitabu haki. Talehi gha kuyandika hilahila ingumanyika ng'ogha ila wandu watangala wangukwinila yiwa kiyandikilwi pambila gha machuva gha 70 badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito. Mlima wa Yelusalemu uyalamisilwi machuva gha 70 badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito, ila myandika wa lihamba hali anguhimulila handa yiwa mlima wa Yelusalemu uwelile wambila kuyalamiswa. Kihitabu kya Wahebulania kiyandikilwi kumlima wa Loma kusula gha 13:24 na inguwachilwa kilandalile kuamonga gha mapinga matangala gha wamkwinila Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Myandika angulangiha yiwa Yesu ni mkulu kupiti walota wa Sapanga na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga. Sula 1:1-4:13</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu akayendelela kulangiha yiwa Yesu ni mkulu kupiti watambika wenikutumikila kulighuta lya Sapanga Yeslusalemu. Sula gha 4:14-7:28</para>
  <para style="io">Hilahila utumikila wa Yesu ni mkulu kupiti lilaghanu lya dahile livile Sapanga kaghola na wandu ghaki kupitila selia ivile ampeghili Musa, sula gha 8:1-10:30</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi badili gha kuyandika yiwa Yesu ni mkulu nesu kwa kila kindu myandika angupegha amonga gha milando gha matendu, sula 10:32-13:17</para>
  <para style="io">Kumwihu myandika anguyomola lihamba hali kwa milando gha kutaya moyu na jambuso, sula 13:18-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Sapanga angulonga na wandu kwa kupitila Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Haku dahile Sapanga alongili mianja itangala na watati wa twenga kwa kutumila walota, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />ila kumachuwa hagha gha mwihu Sapanga angulonga na twenga kwa kupitila Mwana ghaki, yula avile kamvika agholokeli vindu vyogha, na kwa kupitila mweni Sapanga alumbili mlima wogha. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Mweni ni mng'anyimo wa ukulu wa Sapanga, na angulangiha vila Sapanga kawela, anguyambusa vindu vyogha vikonganiki pamonga handa viwela kwa lilando lyaki lyeni makakala. Badili gha kuwaghulula na kuwahumisila wandu sambi zyau, akatama haku kunani kundumba, mbandi gha kuliyila gha Sapanga Mkulu.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Mwana wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Mwana wa Sapanga agholilwe mkulu kupiti watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, na lihina apeghilwi na Sapanga ni likulu kupiti mahina hyogha. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Kwaikiva Sapanga amlongelile ng'ogha hata mmonga wa mtumikila ghaki wa kundumba yiwa, “Wenga ni Mwana ghangu, nenga lelo niwela Tati ghako.” Na hilahila kalongela ng'ogha milando hai kwa mtumikila yoyosi wa kundumba wa Sapanga, “Nenga nitewela Tati ghaki, na mweni atewela Mwana ghangu.” <verse eid="HEB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Kangi Sapanga paamyeghili Mwana ghaki, muwelekwa wa mtumbulo, kumlimawogha ailongile, “Watumikila wogha wa kundumba wa Sapanga wamyupili hayu.” <verse eid="HEB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ila kwa mbandi gha watumikila ghangu wa kundumba, ailongile, “Niwaghalambusa watumikila ghangu wa kundumba kuwela liyegha na watumikila ghaki kuwela mivalika gha lyoto.” <verse eid="HEB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ila kwa habali gha Mwana ghaki Sapanga ailongile, “Wenga Sapanga unkosi ghako utelongosa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, wenga unguwalongosa vila ingupalwa. <verse eid="HEB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Wenga ungupala mighalu hila ingupalwa kuwela na unguyahyomela mahakata. Ndiwa kwaikiva Sapanga kakupegha luheku na utundamilu kupiti wayoko wogha.” <verse eid="HEB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Kangi akalonga, “Bambu, wenga ulumbili mlima wogha haku dahile, na kundumba ukugholile kwa mawoku ghako.” <verse eid="HEB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Hazi zitehuka, ila wenga unguhighala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na zyogha zitehakala handa nguu. <verse eid="HEB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Utevibindililabindilila handa lihabiti na lihakala viteghalambulika handa nguu, ila wenga ni yulayula na kulama kwa wenga kutewela ng'ogha na mwihu. <verse eid="HEB 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Ila ni kwa mtumikila ghani wa kundumba ayesili kumlongela, “Uwaviki wahakata ghako pahi gha ulongosi ghako.” <verse eid="HEB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Ila watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga ni mkina ghani? Ni mipumulo wangumtumikila Sapanga, wangulaghilwa kuhuma kwa Sapanga kuwatanga wala watepokela ulokola.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndiwa njila gha ulokola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Kwaikiva gha nagha tungupalwa kuyalolesa maha yala hyogha tuyoghanilili ili tukotoho kuwela kutali na ghala tuyoghanilile. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Kwaikiva ujumbi hula wapeghilwi wagogolo wa twenga na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga uwonekanili yiwa ni wa chakaka, hata mundu yoyosi avile kaukovekela ng'ogha au kuutundamila anyokolelilwi handa impalili kunyokolwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Tutewesa ghuli kulokoka ikiva tuteupughanya ulokola mkulu handa hau? Ulokola hau, uvile haku mtumbula Bambu mweni utangasili ulokola hau, na kangi wala wayoghanilile wakatuhighilisila twenga yiwa ni chakaka. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Sapanga hilahila ahighilisili ulokola hau kwa kughola vilangihi na makangaso na kwa makakala gha wekaweka, na kuwapegha wandu hupo zya Mpumulo wa Sapanga handa aipalile mweni.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndiwa mweni kuwalongosa wandu kuulokola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Sapanga kauvika ng'ogha mlima wogha hula utehika na hula tunguulongela habali zyaki kuulongosi gha watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Ila kuvile na mahala kutenu kumayandiko kuyandika nagha, “Mundu ni kyani hata umuwachililile, mundu ni niki hata umtundamili? <verse eid="HEB 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Kwa lipindi mayaghani umghola kuwela mnunguna kupiti watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga na ukamvalisa likokoma lya ukulu na utundamilu, <verse eid="HEB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />ukavika vindu vyogha pahi gha ulongosi ghaki,” kwa kuvika vindu vyogha kuulongosi ghaki, Sapanga kaleka ng'ogha kuvika chochosi kuulongosi ghaki mundu. Ila kwa hinaa, tulola ng'ogha handa kuvile na mundu angulongosa vindu vyogha. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Ila tungumlola Yesu avile Sapanga amgholile mnung'una lipindi mayaghani kupiti watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, ili kwa umaha wa Sapanga ahovi kwaikiva gha wandu wogha. Hinaa tungumlola kavikwa likokoma lya ukulu na utundamilu, kwaikiva gha kuhakilwa na kuhova kwaki. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Hinu iwelili maha kwa Sapanga yula alumbili vindu vyogha na kuvigholokela maha, amgholi Yesu kuwela katimila kwa njila gha kuhakilwa, lukani awayeghi wana watangala kuwela pamonga kuukulu ghaki Sapanga. Kwaikiva Yesu ndiwa anguwalongosa wandu wapati kulokoka. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Kwaikiva mweni anguwaghulula wandu kuhuma kusambi, mweni pamonga na wala anguwaghulula, wogha wavili na Tati mmonga. Hinu kwaikiva gha nagha Yesu kawela ng'ogha na honi kuwakema walongo ghaki. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Handa Yesu ailongile, “Wenga Sapanga, nenga nitewatangasila walongu ghangu matendu ghako. Nitekuyinula kumapinga ghao.” <verse eid="HEB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Kangi angulonga, “Nitelivika litumaini lyangu kwa Sapanga.” Hilahila angulonga, “Nabaha, nenga pamonga na wana ghangu wala anipeghili Sapanga.” <verse eid="HEB 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Hinu kwaikiva hagha wana apeghilwi na Sapanga ni wandu, wavile na higha na mwahi, Yesu hilahila ahikile akiwela na higha handa weni. Agholili nagha lukani kwa njila gha kuhova kwaki amuyalamisi Lihyukana mweni makakala gha kihu, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Yesu agholile nagha ili kuwavika pekesu wala wawelili kungalilu gha uhusutu kwaikiva gha kutila kihu. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Hinaa ni chakaka mweni kahika ng'ogha kuwatanga watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, ila kuwatanga wawelekwa wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Kwaikiva gha nagha impalili alandani na walongu ghaki kumighalu hyogha, ili apati kuwela mtambika mkulu mweni luhungu na mchakaka kukumtumikila Sapanga ili agholi ndulumu kwa sambi sya wandu. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Kwaikiva mweni paayesilwi ahakiliwi, hinu anguwesa kuwatanga wala wanguyeswa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ni mkulu kupiti Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Hinu walongo wa nenga mwenga mhaghulwa na Sapanga na kuwela wandu ghaki handa twenga, mumuwachilili nesu hayu Yesu, mndumindumi na Mtambika Mkulu wa ukwinila hau tunguutangasa. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Mweni awelili mchakaka kwa yula mweni kumhaghula, handa vila Musa awelili mchakaka kukuwatumikila wandu wa lighuta lyogha lya Izilaili. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Yesu anguwoneka yiwa ingumpala apeghwi utundamilu mkulu kupiti Musa, handa vila mchenga lighuta kawela na utundamilu mkulu kupiti lighuta lyeni. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Kwaikiva kila lighuta linguchengwa na mundu tenu, ila Sapanga ni mchenga wa kila kindu. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Musa awelili mtumikila mchakaka kumighalu hyogha kwa wandu paghati gha Waizilaili wogha, na alongile yala hyogha yavile Sapanga ateyalonga haku kuulongolo. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ila Kilisito ni mwana mchakaka wa mighalu hyogha avile angulongosa wandu wa lighuta lya Sapanga. Na twenga ndiwa wandu hau, ikiva weka tuteyendelela mbaka mwihu kuwela tugangamala na kuhighala kulitumaini lila tungulikwinila.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupumulila kwa wandu wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Hinu hinaa, handa ailongile Mpumulo wa Sapanga, “Handa pamtehyoghanila lilowi lya Sapanga lelo, <verse eid="HEB 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />mkotoho kuwela watatala, handa wagogolo wa mwenga vila waigholile pawamhyuka Sapanga, na lichuwa wambuyi wa mwenga wamyesili Sapanga kuluvagha. <verse eid="HEB 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Haku ndiwa wambuyi wa mwenga waniyesili na kunilolesa, pamonga na yiwa walola hyogha niyagholili lipindi lya machuva ialobaini. <verse eid="HEB 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Kwaikiva gha nagha wakanighola nihyomi, na nikalonga, ‘Wandu hagha wangubyodoka machuwa hyogha kwa kuleka kukovekela njila zyangu.' <verse eid="HEB 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Hinu nikahyoma na kalapa, nikalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">'Wateyingila ng'ogha kumlima pavile nitewapegha wapumulile’”. <verse eid="HEB 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Hinu walongo wa nenga, mlolesi paghati mwa mwenga, akotoho kuwela mundu mweni kuwela na moyu wa kukotoho kukwinila hata kujivika kutali na Sapanga avile mkomu. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Ila mgangamalisani mwenga kwa mwenga kila lelo, ili kukotoho kuwela na hata mmonga wa mwenga kugholwa aweli mtatala kwa kungongwa na sambi. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Kwaikiva twenga wogha tungughola pamonga na Kilisito paikawela tuteghola pamonga kwa uchakaka lila litumaini tuwelili nalu haku mtumbulo. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Handa Mayandiko yangulonga nagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">“Handa lelo mteliyoghanila lilowi lyaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">mkotoho kuwela watatala handa lipindi lila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">pawanihyukile”. <verse eid="HEB 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Ghuli ni akina ghani wahyoghanilili na kumuhyomelesa Sapanga? Ni wala wogha walongosilwi na Musa kuhuma Misili. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Hila hila ni akina ghani wamgholile Sapanga aweli na lilaka kwa machuva ialobaini? Awahyomelesili wala waigholile sambi, mindumbi ghao ikalandala kula mlivagha. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Sapanga paapalile wakolwi na mahakata, “Wateyingila ng'ogha mahala pa nenga pakumumulilila,” awelili akiwalongela akina ghani? Awelili akiwalongela wala wamuhyukile. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Hinu tungulola yiwa wawesili ng'ogha kuyingila kula mahala kwa kupumulilila kwaikiva gha kukotoho kukwinila kwa weni.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Hinu kwaikiva gha alongeleli Sapanga yiwa tuteyingila kumbumulilo hila yambila kuwela, hinu tulikali mihu kwa hali ili paghati mwa twenga pakotoho kuwela hata mmonga wa twenga atesindwa kuyingila. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Kwaikiva twenga hilahila tutangasilwa Habali Maha handa itangasilwi kwa weni. Ila ujumbi hau uwatangili ng'ogha wandu wa dahile, kwaikiva wauyoghanilili ila waupokelili ng'ogha kwa ukwinila. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Hinu twenga weni kuwela tungukwinila tunguyingila kuhupo gha mbumulilo. Handa ailongile Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">“Nihyomili, nikalapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Wateyingila ng'ogha mahala kwa nenga nipumulila.’”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">Sapanga alongili hagha pamonga na yiwa lihengu lyaki liwelili liyomoka kala kuhuma alumbili mlima wogha. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Mahala kutenu Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulongelela lichuwa lya isaba yiwa, “Badili gha kughola mahengu hyogha Sapanga apumulili lichuwa lya isaba.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Na haku hilahila payandikwa kangi yiwa, “Wateyingila ng'ogha kumbumulilo ghangu.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Kwaikiva, hali laghililo lya kuyingila kumbumulilo lyambila kuwela, kukovekelana na wala watangasililwi Habali Maha kula mtumbulo wasindilwi kuyingila hamu kwa kusindwa kumyitikila Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Sapanga avikili lichuwa lingi lingukemwa “Lelo.” Badili gha kulonga hagha machuwa gha kuulongolo akalonga kangi kwa kupitila Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">“Handa lelo mteyoghanila lilowi lya Sapanga, mkotoho kuleka kuyitikila.” <verse eid="HEB 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Kwaikiva handa Yoshua angaliwela kawapegha wandu wala kupumulila, Sapanga angalilonga ng'ogha kangi kuulongolo kulongelela lichuwa lingi lya mbumulilo. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Hinu lihighala lichuwa lya kupumulila kwa wandu wa Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Kwaikiva kila yula ayingila kumahala pambumulilo gha Sapanga atepumulila kulihengu lyaki handa vila Sapanga apumulili pakamalila lihengu lyaki. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Hinu, tuyangalayi kuyingila kumbumulilo hai, ili akotoho kuwela yoyosi paghati mwa twenga ateleka kuyitikila na kusindwa kuyingila handa waigholile wala wa dahile. <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Kwaikiva lilando lya Sapanga ni lyeni ukomu na makakala, ni likalipa kupiti lipanga lila lyeni kudumula mbandi ivili haku na haku, linguyingila hata kuwesa kulekanisa moyu na mpumulo na hata vikongonu na uloto wa kumihupa. Hilahila lingumanya lukani na mawachilo gha mundu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Kwahela kindu kyeni kulumbwa kinguwesa kuhighwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga, ila vindu vyogha vingugubutulilwa na kuwela lipala kuulongolo ghaki, hayu ndiwa tutemyeghela mavalango gha matendu tughola.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kilisito mtambika mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Hinu, kwaikiva tuvile na Mtambika Mkulu nesu kayingila kundumba, na hayu ni Yesu Mwana wa Sapanga hinu twenga tukoli nesu mighalu tunguyakwinila. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Kwaikiva tuvile na Mtambika Mkulu nesu avile angumanya nesu ulepelelu wa twenga, na mweni ayesilwi handa twenga kwa njila wekaweka ila kaghola ng'ogha sambi. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Hinu tuyendeli pabehi kukitamilo kya ukulu tukileka kuwela na holu, ili tupokeli luhungu na umaha wa kututanga lipindi lya lung'ai.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Kwaikiva kila mtambika mkulu kahaghulilwa paghati gha wandu anguwela kwaikiva gha wandu kumighalu ingumlongelela Sapanga, ili apati kuyegha hupo na matambiku ili wandu walekeselwi sambi. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Kwaikiva mweni hilahila kalepelelwa, hinu anguwesa kuwagholela ulungwana wala wandyungi na wala weni kuwela wayuyughu kukweghwa kumteghu wa sambi. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Kwa nagha ingumpala kuyegha litambiku kwaikiva gha sambi zyaki mweni na hilahila kwa sambi zya wandu waghangi. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Kwahela mundu kangujihaghula kuwela Mtambika Mkulu mweni ngamweni. Ila angupalwa kukemwa na Sapanga handa vila Haluni akemilwi. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Hilahila Kilisito kaipegha ng'ogha mweni utundamilu wa kuwela Mtambika Mkulu, ila ni Sapanga ndiwa amlongelili yiwa, “Wenga ni mwana ghangu, nenga lelo niwela Tati ghako.” <verse eid="HEB 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Hilahila kumahala ghangi angulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">“Wenga ndiwa mtambika machuwa hyogha bila mwihu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">kulihengu lya utambika wa Melekizedeki.” <verse eid="HEB 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Yesu paawelili akilikala haku kumlimawogha, ayupili na kumluwa Sapanga kwa kililo kikulu na masosi, kwa yula awelili na uweso wa kumlokola kukihu, na mweni akahyoghanilwa kwaikiva gha kumtundamila Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Pamonga na yiwa awelili Mwana wa Sapanga, aivulili kuyitikila kupitila maghaso yamkolili. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Pakayomola kugholwa aweli katimila, Yesu akawela mtumbulo wa ulokola wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu kwa wandu wogha wamtundamila. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Hinu Sapanga kamvika kuwela Mtambika Mkulu handa awelili Melekizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makaniso kwa yula anguhyuka ukwinila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Tuvile na milando mitangala gha kulongelelela habali gha utambika hau, ila yuyughu ng'ogha kuyalongela, kwaikiva mwenga ni watopa wa kumanya. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Uchakaka ni yiwa lipindi hali hinaa mwenga mngalipalwa kuwela wavula, ila mmbila mngupala kuvulwa kangi ghala mavulo gha mtumbulo wa ukwinila, badili gha kupala mulyo ukamala mwenga mngupala maweli. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Kwaikiva yula anguyonga maweli weka hayu kambila mwana mnung'una, kwa nagha angumanya ng'ogha haki maha au haki kihakata. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ila wandu weni kukamala ndiwa wani kulyegha milyo ikamala, wala wavulilwi kwa milandano kulekanisa maheli na mahakata.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Hinu, tuleki kuhyetu ghala mavulo tutumbulile kuvulwa patuwelile tumanya ng'ogha chochosi kuhabali gha Kilisito, tuyendi kuulongolo kwa ghala yeni kukamala, na ng'ogha kuvika mghomba kwa kuyendelela kulongelelela kulekana na ngalilu imhekelesa ng'ogha Sapanga na ghala mavulo yeni kulongelelela habali zya kumkwinila Sapanga, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />mavulo gha ubatiso na gha kuwayupila kwa kuwavikila mawoku na gha uhinduko wa kihu na gha ulamulo wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Kwa kughola nagha tuteyendelela kukula na kukamala kuukwinila Sapanga paatepala. <verse eid="HEB 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Kwaikiva ni yuyughu ng'ogha kuwaghola kangi waleki sambi wandu wala wapokela vindu maheli kuhuma kundumba kwa njila gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />kangi wangumanya maheli yiwa Lilando lya Sapanga ni maheli na hilahila wangumanya makakala gha ulongosi wa Sapanga kumlimawogha hula utehika, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />kangi wandu hagha wakaleka kila wangukikwinila kwa lukani iwesekana ng'ogha kuwahuyisa hagha ili wapati kuleka sambi kwaikiva wangumvamba Yesu kwa lihanja lya ivili. <verse eid="HEB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Kwaikiva lutupi lula lungutonyelwa ndonya lihanja kwa lihanja na kumelesa mimela yeni kuwapegha mabeno watukutula hai ihighilwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Ila lutupi palikahumisa mihomi na migugu, itewela ng'ogha na umaha, hinu mtukutula atekungula hagha na kumwihu ghaki ateyanyanya lyoto. <verse eid="HEB 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Mwenga wapalwa wa nenga pamonga na yiwa niwayandikila kwa milando ikalipa; hata nenga nivile na uchakaka yiwa mngughola ghamaha yenikulangiha yiwa mlokolwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Kwaikiva Sapanga ni mmaha anguisemwa ng'ogha lihengu lya mwenga na upalo hula muulangisili kwaikiva gha mweni kwa vila muwatangili wandu ghaki na vila munguyendelela kuwatanga. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Luhujulu lwa twenga ni yiwa kila mmonga wa mwenga agholi kuyangalai hakuhaku mbaka kumwihu, ili ghala mnguyatumainila yawesi kutimila. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Hinu mkotoho kuwela wapweli, ila muweli handa wala wangukwinila na weni ufumilifu, wakapokela ghala alalongili Sapanga.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sapanga akilongilile ni chakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Sapanga ampeghili Abulahamu akilongilile, alapili kwa lihina lyaki mweni, kwaikiva kwahela avili mkulu kupiti mweni ikamuwesesa kwa hayu mkulu kulapa kwa kutumila lihina lyaki likulu. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Sapanga alongili, “Chakaka nitekuhighila na nitekupegha wawelekwa watangala.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Abulahamu alindilili kwa ufumilifu na akapokela hila alongelelilwi na Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Kwaikiva wandu pawalapa, wangulapa kwa kutumila lihina lya mmonga avile mkulu kupiti weni, na kilapo kila kinguhumisa utatala wogha. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Kwa njila hai Sapanga, apalili kulangiha paluagha kwa wala watepokela akilongelile yiwa mweni kawesa ng'ogha kuhyuka kila akilongelile, akalihighilisa kwa kutumila kilapo. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Sapanga agholile vindu havi viivili, ili atupeghi moyu twenga weni kumtuhilila ili tukoli litumaini lya mighalu itehika. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Tuvili na litumaini hali handa nanga gha kulama kwa twenga. Litumaini hali linguyingila mbaka kumahala pambuleti pee kundumba. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Mahala pavile Yesu mlongola wa twenga ayingilili kwaikiva gha twenga, mweni kawela mtambika mkulu machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, handa Melekisadeki vila kaiwela.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Mtambika Melekisadeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Hayu Melekisadeki awelili nkosi wa mlima wa Selemu, na mtambika wa Sapanga Mkulu. Abulahamu paawelili anguhuya kuhuma kungondu kula awelili kawakoma wankosi, Melekisadeki akakongine nayu, akamhighila. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Hinu Abulahamu akampegha lilundila limonga lya ikumi lya vindu vyogha atolili haku, lihina lya Melekisadeki lingumaanisa, “Nkosi mweni kubhaghula ng'ogha,” na kangi ni nkosi wa kumahala wapakema Salemu, ingumaanisa “Nkosi wa kulikala kwa kuponga.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Hayu kahela Tati hilahila nyongu, kahela ukolu, kahela mtumbulo hilahila hata mwihu wa machuwa ghaki. Melikisadeki ni handa Mwana wa Sapanga, mweni anguyendelela kuwela mtambika machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="HEB 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Hinu mumuwachilile vila mundu hayu kawela mkulu, hata mnahota wa twenga mkulu Abulahamu akampegha lilundila limonga lya ikumi lya vindu vyogha atolili kungondu. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Hinu tungumanya yiwa kukovekelana na selia gha Sapanga ampeghili musa, wawelekwa wa Lawi wala wenikuwela ni watambika, wangupalwa kutola mahala gha lilundila lya ikumi kuhuma kwa wandu, ingumaanisa walongo wa weni, pamonga na yiwa na weni hilahila ni wawelekwa wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Ila hayu Melekisadeki kawela ng'ogha wa ukolu wa Lawi, pamonga na hagha akapokela mahala gha lilundila lya ikumi kuhuma kwa Abulahamu, kangi akamuhighila Abulahamu mundu avile kalongelwa yiwa atepeghwa kila akilongelile Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Kwahela utatala yiwa hayu mweni kuhighila ni mkulu kupiti yula mweni kuhighilwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Hilahila, hagha watambika weni kupokela lilundila lya ikumi, ni wandu weni kuhova, ila haku yula mweni kupokela lipinga lya ikumi, hayu Melekisadeki, ingulongwa yiwa anguyendelele kulama handa yailongile Mayandiko gha Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Hinu tunguwesa kulonga nagha, lipindi Abulahamu pakayegha lilundila lya ikumi lya hindu ghaki, Lawi hilahila ayeghili kupitila kwa Abulahamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Hinu tunguwesa kulonga yiwa hata Lawi mweni kupokela lilundu lya ikumi kuhuma kwa walongo ghaki, na mweni apeghili lilundu lya ikumi kwa Melekisadeki kupitila kwa Abulahamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Waizilaili wapeghilwi selia na Sapanga na selia hazi zihumila kwa utambika wa Walawi. Ila utambika hau uwelili na malepelelu, hinu ikapalwa uhiki utambika ghangi handa wa Melekisadeki ulandana ng'ogha na hula wa Haluni. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Kwaikiva utambika paughalambuka, hilahila selia ingupalwa ighalambuki. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Hilahila Bambu wa twenga yula wangumlongela kumighalu hai, awelili mundu wa likabila ghangi na kwahela mundu wa likabila lyaki kawesa kutumikila kulughanja akiwela handa mtambika. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Kwaikiva ni chakaka yiwa Bambu wa twenga ahumili kukiwelekwa kya Yudasi, kivile Musa kakikema ng'ogha paawelili angulongela kwa habali gha watambika.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtambika ghangi mweni kulandana na Melekisadeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Kangi mghalu hau ni chakaka nesu, mtambika ghangi mwenikulandana na Melekisadeki kawoneka kala. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Mweni kagholwa ng'ogha kuwela mtambika kwa selia na malaghilo gha wandu, ila awelili mtambika kwa makakala gha ukomu ghaki uwela ng'ogha na mwihu. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Kwaikiva Mayandiko yangulonga yiwa, “Wenga ni mtambika machuwa hyogha bila mwihu kwa mlandano wa Melekisadeki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Hinu hila selia gha dahile gha yeni kulongelela utambika iyalamiswa kwaikiva gha kuwela ipola kala na gha maha ng'ogha. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Kwaikiva selia iyegha ng'ogha utimililo kwa mghalu wowosi. Ila hinaa, kwa njila ghangi tuyeghelwa litumaini maha nesu, na kwa kuwela kwa litumaini hali tunguwesa kumuheghelela pabehi Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Kupiti hyogha, Lipindi Walawi wanguvikwa kuwela watambika kuwelili ng'ogha na kilapo ila haku kuvile na kilapo kya Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Ila Yesu agholilwi kuwela mtambika kwa kilapo, pala Sapanga paamlongelili, “Bambo kalapa, na mweni ateghalambula ng'ogha lukani lwaki, ‘Wenga ni Mtambika machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.’” <verse eid="HEB 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Hinu kwa kuwela na kilapo haki, Yesu ni chakaka wa lilaghano maheli nesu kuhuma kwa Sapanga kwaikiva gha wandu ghaki. <verse eid="HEB 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Kwaikiva watambika wala waghangi wawelili wandu hela, hinu lipindi lyao lya kuhova palihikile wakahova wakotoho kuyendelela na mahengu ghao na hai ndiwa kwaikiva wakawoneka watangala. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ila kwaikiva Yesu angulama machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na utambika ghaki uvile ng'ogha na mwihu. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Hinu mweni anguwesa kuwalakola wala wangumuyendela Sapanga kwa kupitila mweni, kwaikiva mweni angulama machuwa hyogha bila mwihu na kuwayupila kwa Sapanga, <verse eid="HEB 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />hinu Yesu ndiwa angupalwa kuwela Mtambika Mkulu kwaikiva gha twenga, kana sambi ng'ogha wala uhakata mghati mwaki, Sapanga ambhaghulile kuhuma kwa waghola sambi na akamkwelesa kundumba. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Mweni kapala ng'ogha kuyegha litambiku kila lelo handa watambika waghangi wakulunga, akitumbula kwa sambi syaki mweni, na kuulongola sambi sya wandu wogha. Kwaikiva kaghola vila lihanja limonga hela lipindi pakajitola mweni kuhova. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Kukovekelana na Selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa wandu wawelili wakivikwa kuwela watambika pamonga na yiwa wawelili waghola sambi ila kuulongolo Sapanga amhaghulila Mwana ghaki aweli mtambika mkulu avile katimila machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu mtambika wa twenga mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Hinu, mghalu wa maha tungupalwa kulonga ni hau: Twenga tuvile na mtambika mkulu wa nagha, avile angulikala upandi wa kuliyila wa kitamilo kya unkosi kya Sapanga mkulu kundumba. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Haku kundumba angughola lihengu lya Utambika Mkulu mahala Pambulete pee, ingumaanisa mghati mwa mahala pachakaka pakuyupila pakundumba kuchengwili na Bambu na ng'ogha mundu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Kila Mtambika Mkulu kahaghulwa kumyeghela Sapanga hupo na litambiku. Hinu Mtambika Mkulu wa twenga angupalwa na mweni aweli na kindu kya kuyegha. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Handa Yesu angaliyendelela kulikala haku kumlimawogha, angaliwesa ng'ogha kuwela mtambika, kwaikiva kuvile na watambika waghangi wanguyegha matambiku kwa kukovekela selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Mahengu ghao gha kiutambika ni mlandano hela na kisisi kya ghala yavile kundumba. Ingulandana na vila amlongelili Musa. Lipindi Musa paawelili pabehi na kuchenga kibimilo, Sapanga amlongelili, “Chakaka ugholi kila kindu kukovekelana na hula mlandano ulangusilwi kula kulitumbi.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ila hinaa Yesu kapeghwa utumikila wa kiutambika uvile maha nesu kupiti hula wa weni. Handa vila lilaghano lila alihighilisili kwa kuwakonganisa wandu na Sapanga ni maha nesu, kwaikiva livili na mghomba ghaki kumighalu yeni kuwela maha nesu.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Kwaikiva lila lilaghano lya mtumbulo handa lingaliwela ng'ogha ulepelelu kungaliwesa ng'ogha kuwela na lilaghano lya ipili. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ila Sapanga alolile ulepelelu kwa wandu, hinu akalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">“Machuwa yanguhika, angulonga Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">niteghola lilaghano lyonu na wandu wa lighuta lya Izilaili na lighuta lya Yudasi.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Lilaghano hali litewela ng'ogha handa lila nigholile na watati ghao paniwalongola kwa umaha ili kuwahumisa kuhuma kumlima wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">kwaikiva wayendelela ng'ogha kukola lilaghano lya nenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">na nenga nikawaleka, angulonga Bambu.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Hali ndiwa lilaghano nitelighola na wandu wa Izilaili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">machuwa yahika, angulonga Bambu, Nitevika selia zyangu mumawachilo ghao na kuyandika mumioyu ghao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Nenga nitewela Sapanga wa weni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">na weni watewela wandu wa nenga.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Kwahela mundu atewesa kumvula myaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">hata ghangi kumlongela myaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Ummanyi Bambu’.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">Kwaikiva wogha, wanung'una na wakulu, watenimanya nenga.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Nitewalekesela mahakata ghao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">na kuleka kukumbwike kangi sambi syao.” <verse eid="HEB 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Sapanga paangulonga hali ni lilaghanu “lyonu,” angulighola lila lya mtumbulo ni lya dahile. Na kindu chochosi kya dahile kinguwela kihakala na nipabehi kuyaghamika.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Kuyupa kwa kundumba na kuyupa kwa mlima wogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Hinu Lilaghano lila lya mtumbulo liwelili na njila zyaki zya kuyupa na mahala pahaghulilwi pakumyupila Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Lihema lichengwili likiwela na mahala ghaki papanji wakipakema Pambuleti pee. Hamu kuwelili na mbaku gha kuvikila limbamba, mesa na mibumunda iwela ivikwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Kuhyetu gha lipazila lya ipili, kuwelili na kibimilo wakikema mahala Pambuleti Pee. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Mghati mula kuwelili na kyombu kya kutumililila ubani, kigholilwi na zahabu. Hilahila kuwelili na lisanduku lya lilaghano lipakalwa zahabu mbandi zyogha na mghati mwa lisanduku lila kuwelili na kimbundi kya zahabu kyeni mana, na hyatu gha Haluni yeni kutomola mahamba mmbalimbali, na fibau viiwili vyeni kuyandikwa malaghanu. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Kunani mwa lila lisanduku kuwelili na viumbi weni mbapatilu, na mbapatilu zyao ziligubika kitamilo kya ukulu, ila hinaa tuwesa ng'ogha kulongela mighalu hai kwa utali.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Havi ndiwa wavikili vindu vila vyogha. Hinu watambika wayingilili machuwa hyogha kukila kyumba kya mtumbulo kwa kughola mahengu ghao. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Ila kulihema lila lya ivili mtambika mkulu anguyingila weka ghaki na kangi hai iwelili lihanja limonga hela na kwa lichuva. Na hayu apalilwi kuyegha mula mwahi gha likokolu kuyeghwa handa litambiko kwaikiva gha sambi syaki mweni na kwa waghangi kukovekelana na sambi syau. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Kukovekelana na ndyangilu hai Mpumulo wa Sapanga anguvula lipala yiwa lipindi kibimilo kya panji pakiwela kikali kinguyendelela kughola lihengu, njila zya kuyingila mahala Pambuleti Pee kwa wandu waghangi ikawela yambila kuwoposolwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Hau ni mlandano wa lipindi lya hinaa ungulangiha yiwa hupo na litambiku lila liyeghwa kwa Sapanga liwesa ng'ogha kumghulula. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Hagha hyogha ni mighalu gha ndyangilu gha wandu hela, milyo na vinywegha na kuighulula kwa panji. Hagha hyogha malaghilo yangupalwa kuyendelela mbaka pala Sapanga paateghola lilaghanu lyonu.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Kilisito kahika kala, akiwela Mtambika Mkulu wa mighalu ivile maha, ivile hinaa ihika kala. Na mweni angughola utumikila ghaki kulihema ghangi lya maha na litimila nesu. lihema hali ligholwa ng'ogha na mawoko gha wandu na kwa nagha ng'ogha lya mlima wogha hau. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Mweni ayingilili mahala Pambuleti Pee lihanja limonga hela, akiwela katola ng'ogha mwahi gha mbuhi na ng'ombi, ila katola mwahi ghaki mweni, akatupatila ukombola wa machuwa hyogha bilamwihu. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Kwa nagha wandu wala wajumilwa ng'ogha kumayupo wawelili wakighululika na kuwela maha pawayitilwa mwahi gha mbuhi na ng'ombi likambaku pamonga na malifu gha ng'ombi mnung'una. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Ila kwa mwahi gha Kilisito, mighalu mikulunga nesu ingugholeka! Kwa makakala gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, Kilisito ajihumisili mweni kuwela litambiku litimila kwa Sapanga. Mwahi ghaki utetughulula matendu yeni kuyegha kihu, ili tupati kumtumikila Sapanga avile mkomu. <verse eid="HEB 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Kwaikiva gha nagha, Kilisito ni mghola ndulumu wa lilaghano lyonu, kwa kupitila kuhova kwaki awakombolili wandu kuhuma kusambi wawelili wangughola haku kuhyetu wakiva na uloghosi wa lilaghano lya mtumbulo, lukani wala wahaghulwa na Sapanga wapati ulihi wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu hula awahighilisilili. <verse eid="HEB 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Machuwa hyogha lihamba liyandikwa kwa kulihi hindu lingughola lihengu hela pala yula mwenikuyandika kahova chakaka. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Kwaikiva lihamba linguwela na makakala weka lipindi mundu kahova kala, katu unguwesa ng'ogha kuwela na makakala lipindi yula auyandikili hula ulihi ambila kamkomu. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Kwaikiva gha nagha hata lila lilaghano lya mtumbulo livikwa ng'ogha yaghiyaghi ila mbaka pauyitika mwahi. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Kwaikiva, mtumbulo Musa awatangasilili wandu amuli zyogha handa iwela ku selia, hinu akatola mwahi gha ng'ombi mnung'una pamonga na masi, na kwa mahamba gha libiki lya isopo na pamba ngeli, akakimichila kila kihitabu kya selia na wandu wogha. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Akilonga, “Hau ndiwa mwahi wa lilaghano wenikuilangiha yiwa lilaghanu hali ni lya chakaka, livile Sapanga kawalaghila kulitundamila.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Hilahila Musa akamichila hula mwahi kukibimilo na kuvyombu vya kuyupila. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Chakaka kukovekelana na selia, vindu vyogha vinguhululwa kwa mwahi, na sambi siwesa kuhumiswa ikiva mwahi uyitwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litambiku lya Kilisito linguhumisa sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Vindu havi vivile ni mlandano hela wa mighalu chakaka gha kundumba, vipalilwi kughululwa kwa njila hai, ila vindu vya kundumba vingupala litambiku livile maha nesu. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Kwaikiva Kilisito kayingila ng'ogha mahala Pambuleti Pee pachengilwi na mawoko gha wandu, wavile ni mlandano wa kila kivile chakaka. Mweni ayingilili kundumba chakaka, ili awoneki kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwaikiva gha twenga. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Mtambika Mkulu wa Wayahudi anguyingila kumahala Pambuleti Pee kila lichuwa, akipapa mwahi gha likokolu. Ila Kilisito kayingila ng'ogha hamu lukani ajitoli mweni litambiku mihanja itangala. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Handa ingaliwela nagha, angalipalwa Kilisito kuhakilwa mihanja itangala kuhuma kulumbwa kwa mlima wogha. Ila hinaa, machuva payahika pabehi mwihu ghaki, mweni kahuma lihanja limonga hela, kuhumisa sambi kwa kujitola mweni aweli litambiku. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Handa mundu vila kavikilwa kuhova lihanja limonga hela na badili gha kuhova kulamulwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Hilahila Kilisito ajitolili lihanja limonga hela kuwela litambiko ili azitoli sambi sya wandu watangala, na mweni atehika lihanja lya ipili, ng'ogha kutola sambi, ila kuwayeghela ulokola wala wandu wangumlindila kwa luhujulu nesu.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Hinu kwaikiva selia gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa ni kisisi hela kya mighalu maha hila gha kuulongolo, ng'ogha picha gha mighalu chakaka. Kwaikiva gha nagha, iwesekana ng'ogha kwa matambiko yayeghwa lichuva kwa lichuva, kuwaghola wala wangutundamila hai waweli watimila. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Handa hagha wandu wamtundamila Sapanga wangaliwela wangughululwa sambi syao chakaka, wangaliyendelela ng'ogha kuilola yiwa wavile na sambi kangi, na matambiko hagha hyogha yangaliwela ng'ogha kangi. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Ila kwa njila gha matambiko hagha wandu wangukumbuswa sambi syao kila lichuva, <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Kwaikiva mwahi gha ng'ombi likambaku na mbuhi iwesa ng'ogha kuhumisa sambi.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Ndiwa kwaikiva Kilisito paawelili akihika kumlimawogha, amlongelili Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">Upalili ng'ogha litambiko hata hupo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">ila mhigha univikilili kala.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Matambiku gha kulungusa au</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">na hupo gha kuhumisa sambi yakunoghela ng'ogha.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Ndiwa nikalongela, “Nabaha Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">kutimilisa yala unguyapala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">handa niyandikilwa kukihitabu kya selia.” <verse eid="HEB 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Mtumbulo ailongile, “Angunoghelwa ng'ogha na matambiku, matambiku gha kulunguswa na gha kuhumisa sambi.” Ailongile nagha pamonga na yiwa matambiku hagha hyogha yangutolwa kukovekelana na selia wenga mweni uwapeghili. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Hinu akalonga, “Nabaha, nihika kughola mapalo ghako.” Hinu Sapanga kahumisa hagha matambiku hyogha gha dahile na mahala paki akalivika litambiku lighangi limonga. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Kwaikiva Yesu Kilisito atimilisili mapalo gha Sapanga, twenga tungughululwa sambi kwa lila litambiku lya mhigha ghaki ajihumilisi lihanja limonga hela, ikakwila.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Kila mtambika angugholoka kuulongolo gha Sapanga kila lelo kwa kughola mayupu na kuyegha litambiku lilalila mihanja itangala hali liwesa ng'ogha kuhumisa sambi. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Ila Kilisito agholile litambiku limonga hela kwaikiva gha sambi, litambiku lyeni kughola lihengu machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na hinu akalikala upandi wa utundamilu wa Sapanga, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />angulindila wahakata ghaki mbaka wavikwi pahi gha ulongosi ghaki. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Hinu kwa litambiku lyaki limonga kawaghola wala waghululilwi na kuwela wandu ghaki machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga hilahila angutulongela habali hai akilonga,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Hali ndiwa Lilaghano nitelighola na weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">machuwa gha kuulongolo. Nitevika selia ghangu mumioyu gha weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">na kuyandika kumawachilo ghao.” <verse eid="HEB 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Kangi akayendelela kulonga, “Ngumbuki ng'ogha kangi sambi hata mahakata ghao.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Hinu, sambi pazihumiswa, patewela ng'ogha na lukani lwa kuyegha litambiko lya kuhumisa sambi.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tumuhikili Sapanga pabehi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Hinu, walongu, kwa mwahi gha Yesu tungupeghwa uhighiliso mkulu wa kuyingila mahala Pambuleti Pee. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Mweni katuwoposelela njila hyonu, njila gha ukomu, kupitila lila lipazila, ingumaanisa higha ghaki mweni. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Hinu, tuvile na Mtambika Mkulu avile na ulongosi kulighuta lya Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Hinu tumhikili Sapanga kwa mioyu mbuleti na ukwinila utimila, tukiwela na mioyu ivile ighululwa kuhuma kulukani luhakata, na mihigha gha twenga ikiva ighululwa kwa masi mbulete. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tulikoli nesu lila litumaini lyetu tungulikwinila na kulilonga, kwaikiva yula atupeghili hali lilaghano kangughalambuka ng'ogha. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Tuyangalahi kupeghana moyu ili tupalane na kugholelana umaha. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Tukotoho kuleka kukongine pamonga, handa waghangi vila waileka kughola nagha machuwa hyogha, ila tupeghani moyu twenga kwa twenga na kupiti hyogha tugholi hai mighalu kwaikiva lichuwa lya Bambu lya pabehi kuhika.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Kwaikiva, patuyendelela kughola sambi kwa lukani badili gha kumanya uchakaka, kwahela litambiko liwesa kutolwa kangi kwaikiva gha kuhumisa sambi. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Lila lihighala ni kulindila hela kwa holu ulamula wa Sapanga kwa lyoto likalipa litewayalamisa wala wogha wangumkingama Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Mundu yoyosi kapughanya selia gha Musa akomilwi wakiva wamwonela ng'ogha luhungu pakiwela na uhighilisu gha wandu waivili mbaka waitatu. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Mnguliwachila niki, mundu yula mweni kumpughanya Mwana wa Sapanga na kupughanya mwahi wa lilaghano lya Sapanga amghululili, na mundu yula kamlighu Mpumulo wa Sapanga mweni kuyegha ghamaha, ingumpala apokeli kunyokolwa kwa ukulunga wa ghuli? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Kwaikiva tungummanya Sapanga alongile, “Ni lihengu lya nenga kuhuyisila. Ni nenga nitehuyisila.” Na mweni akailongela kangi, “Bambu Sapanga atewalamula wandu ghaki.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Ni mghalu wa kutisa nesu mundu kakongine na ulamulo kuhuma ku Sapanga avile mkomu.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Mngumbuki mighalu iwoneka lipindi lya kuhyetu pamtumbulile kumkwinila Kilisito. Pamonga na yiwa mkolilwe na mahakilo ila mfumilili. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Lihanja ghangi wawelili wakiwalighu na kuhakilwa paluagha, lipindi lighangi muwelili na luhujulu lwa kuwatanga wala wagholelilwi uhakata. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Muwawonelili luhungu wala wawelili mukihungu, na mwenga mujumilili kwa luheku kupokwa hindu, kwaikiva mmanyili yiwa mumioyu gha mwenga muwelili na hindu maha nesu na vyeni kulikala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Hinu mkotoho kuuleka hau mgangamalo, kwaikiva utewapatila hupo ngulu kuhuma kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Mngupalwa kufumilila ili pamyomola kughola mapalo gha Sapanga mpati kila wahighilisili. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Kwaikiva, handa vila Mayandiko yayandikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">“Kuhighala lipindi mayaghani hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">hayu mwenikuhika atehika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">itetola ng'ogha lipindi litali kuhika.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Ila mundu ghangu avile maha atelikala kwa kunikwinila nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">ila pakaleka kunikwinila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">nitempala ng'ogha.” <verse eid="HEB 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Ila twenga ng'ogha amonga gha wala wenikuleka kumkwinila Sapanga na kuyaghamika, ila twapamonga na wala weni kumkwinila na kulokolwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Kumkwinila Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Hinu kukwinila ni kuwela na mawachilo yeni uhighilisu gha kupokela kila ungukilindila, kangi kukwinila nesu mighalu hila ivile tunguilola ng'ogha hinaa. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Kwa njila hai gha kumkwinila Sapanga wagogolo wa twenga wamhekelesili nesu Sapanga.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Kwa kukwinila tungumanya yiwa mlima wogha ulumbilwi kwa lilando lya Sapanga, vindu vyogha viwoneka vilumbilwi kwa vindu viwoneka ng'ogha.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Kwa kukwinila Abeli amyeghelili Sapanga litambiko maha nesu kupiti Kaini. Kwa kukwinila kwaki akajumilwa na Sapanga yiwa ni wamaha, Sapanga mweni ajumilili litambiku lyaki, pamonga na yiwa Abeli ahovili ila kukwinila kwaki kunguyendelela kuwela mlandano mmaha mbaka lelo.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Kwa kumkwinila Sapanga kukamghola Henoko atolilwi, kuhuma kumlimawogha hau bila kuhova. Kawoneka ng'ogha kangi kwaikiva Sapanga awelili kamtola. Mayandiko yangulangiha yiwa pambila gha kutolwa, mweni awelili kamhekelesa Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Kwahela mundu kanguwesa kumhekelesa Sapanga pakawela ng'ogha na kumkwinila Sapanga. Kwaikiva kila mundu mweni kumyendela Sapanga angupalwa kukwinila yiwa Sapanga kabaha, na anguwapegha hupo wala wangumuhakula kwa kuyangala.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Kwa kukwinila Nuhu kukamghola ayitikili Sapanga pamkanisili kunani gha mighalu itehika kuulongolo ivile iwelili yambila kuhumila. Ndiwa akachenga lisafina ili Sapanga awalokoli mweni pamonga na wandu wa mlighuta lyakina kuwalamula wandu wa kumlima wogha wenikuwela wamkwinila ng'ogha Sapanga, kwaikiva gha nagha ikamghola Nuhu ajumilwi na Sapanga.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Kukwinila kwaki Abulahamu, kukamghola amyitikili Sapanga pakalongelwa ayendi kumlima uvile Sapanga angalimpegha kuulongolo paweli kwa mweni, ayitikilili na akayenda, pamonga na yiwa amanyili ng'ogha kula anguyenda. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Kwa kukwinila kwaki alikalili handa mhenja kumlima alaghilililwi na Sapanga. Alikalili haku kukibimilo handa walikalili Isaka na Yakobu haku dahile, wavile hilahila na weni wawelili na lilaghano handa lila. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Kwaikiva Ibulahimu alindilili kulola mlima weni mghomba ugangamala, mlima hula Sapanga mweni ndiwa mchenga mkulu awachililile na kuuchenga.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Kwa kupitila kukwinila, Sala mweni hilahila, pamonga na yiwa awelili mgogolo nesu, apeghilwi uweso wa kupokela ndumbu kwaikiva akwinilili yiwa Sapanga atetimilisa lilaghano lyaki. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Kwa nagha, kuhuma kwa mundu hayu mmonga, Abulahamu, mweni kuwela handa kahova kala, wakahumila wandu watangala wawesa ng'ogha kuvalangwa handa ndondwa zya kundumba na mhanga wa mmbali mwa bahali.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Wandu hagha wogha wahovili kunu wakimkwinila Sapanga. Wahovili pambila gha kupokela mighalu ivile Sapanga awelili kayalonga atewapegha, ila kwa kutali wayalolili, wakahekelela, na kulonga lipala lipala yiwa weni wawelili wahenja na wenikuwela na mwanja hela kumlima wogha. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Wandu wala wangulonga milando handa hagha, wangulangiha lipala yiwa wanguhakula mlima ghao wenibaha. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Handa wangaliwachilila mlima hula wahumila dahile, wangaliwesa kuhuya haku. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ila badili ghaki wangupala mlima wa maha nesu, kwaikiva gha nagha Sapanga kalola ng'ogha honi kukemwa Sapanga wa weni kwaikiva kawayandalila kala mlima kwaikiva gha weni.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Abulahamu kwa kumkwinila kwaki Sapanga kukamghola amtoli mwana ghaki Isaka handa litambiku paamyesili. Mweni awelili kalongelwa na Sapanga yiwa angalipokela wana watangala, akajumila kumyegha mwana ghaki, yula awelili mwana ghaki wa weka, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Sapanga awelili kamlongela, “Ni kwa kupitila Isaka utepokela wawelekwa ghako.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Abulahamu akwinilili yiwa Sapanga anguwesa kuwahindula wandu wahovili hai ni handa Abulahamu kanipokela kangi mwana ghaki kuhuma kukihu.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Kukwinila kwa Isaka kukayambusa awahighilili Yakobu na Esau, wapati highili zila zitehika kuulongolo.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Kwa kupitila kukwinila kwa Yakobu, paawelili anguhova kukamghola, amhighilili kila mmonga wa wana wa Yusufu, na kumyupa Sapanga akiva kasaghamila mutu gha mkongocho ghaki. <verse eid="HEB 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Kwa kukwinila kwaki, Yusufu paawelili pabehi na kuhova, alongili habali zya kuhuka kwa wana wa Izilaili haku Misili na akawapegha malaghilo gha mihupa ghaki.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Kwa kupitila kukwinila, walela wa Musa kukawaghola wamhighi Musa kwa lipindi lya miehi miitatu badili gha kuwelekwa, kwaikiva walolili yiwa mmaha, hata watila ng'ogha lilaghilo lya nkosi wa Misili.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Kwa kukwinila kwa Musa paawelili mundu mkomi, akalema kukemwa mwana wa biti Falao. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Aliwachilili yiwa ni mbaha kuhakilwa pamonga na wandu wa Sapanga kupiti kuhekelelela sambi kwa lipindi lihupi. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Alolili yiwa kupughanywa kwaikiva gha Kilisito kuvile na hupo ngulu nesu kupiti, unaisa wa Misili, kwaikiva awelili kalindila hupo gha kuulongolo ivile Sapanga atempegha.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Kwa kukwinila Musa kukamghola ahuki ku Misili bila kutila lilaka lya nkosi, kwaikiva awelili handa angumlola yula Sapanga kawoneka ng'ogha. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Kwa kukwinila akaighola lichuwa lya Pasaka, na kulaghila mwahi uyitwi kunani gha mihimu gha milyango, lukani yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga mweni kukoma wandu akotoho kuwakoma wawelekwa wa mtumbulo wa Izilaili.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Kwa kukwinila wandu wa Izilaili wahubhukili bahali gha Shamu handa wangutyanga mahala kuyumu, ila Wamisili pawayesa kughola nagha wahovili kumasi.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Kwa kukwinila mikuta gha mlima wa Yeliko iguwili badili gha Waizilaili pawatindila kala mikuta hila kwa machuwa isaba. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Kwa kukwinila kwa Lahabu mwenikuwela mngongola kukamghola akotoho kukomwa pamonga na wala wamhyukile Sapanga, kwaikiva mweni awakemili kuukaya walaghililwi kulolesa mlima wa weni.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Hinu nilonge niki? Nivile ng'ogha na lipindi lya kulongela habali zya Gideoni na Balaka na Samsoni na Yefita na Daudi na Samweli na walota, <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />kwa kukwinila hagha wogha watovanili ngondu na wankosi, wakasinda, wagholili yala yamhekelesa Sapanga, wakapokela yala alaghilili Sapanga. Wawopili milomo gha himba, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />wajimisili makakala gha lyoto, walokokili kuughwegha kwa lipanga mngondu, wapeghilwi makakala badili gha kuwela wawesa ng'ogha, wakawela na makakala kungondu na kuwasinda watovangondo wa kihenja. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Na wadala wala weni kwinilili wahuyisililwi walongu ghao wala wahovili wakiwela wahindulwa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">ila amonga gha weni wakanili kuwoposolwa, wakahakilwa mbaka kuhova ili wapati kuhinduliwa na kuyingila kungalilu maha nesu. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Waghangi wapughanyilwi na kutovwa hyatu, na kuwopwa minyololu na kuvikwa muuwopwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Waghangi wahovili kwa kutovwa na maganga, waghangi wadumulilwi vipandi vipandi kwa msumenu, au kuhova kwa lipanga. wawelili wakiyelejayeleja wakivala ngosi gha kondolu au mbuhi, wakilikala wakiva wavile ng'ogha na hindu, wakihakilwa na kugholwa maha ng'ogha. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Wandu wa mlima wogha wawapalile ng'ogha kuwela na wandu maha handa hagha. Hagha wakapalwa kutindila tindila kulivagha na kumitumbi, kumambaku na lyumba pahi gha lutupi.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Wandu hagha wogha wawonekanili yiwa wamaha kwaikiva gha kukwinila kwau, ila kwahela hata mmonga wa weni kapokela ghala Sapanga alongile yiwa atewapegha. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Kwaikiva Sapanga awelili katuvikila mighalu maha nesu ili twenga pamonga na weni tupokeli ghala yavile Sapanga ailongoile yiwa atetupegha.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Sapanga ndiwa Tati wa twenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Kwaikiva tuiwonela weni kwa wayetu watutindila vila wamkwinilili Sapanga, hinu tutaghi kutali yala hyogha yangutuhuyisa kuyetu kumhekelesa Sapanga, twenga tutuwi mbilo kwa ufumilifu kumasindano ghala yavikwa kuulongolo gha twenga. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Tumyendeli Yesu yula ndiwa mtumbulo wa ukwinila hau wa twenga na ndiwa mweni kuwesa kutimilisa ukwinila wa twenga, kwaikiva gha luheku luvikwa kuulongolo gha mweni afumilili lipingika, na kuwela ng'ogha na honi gha hali lipingika, hinaa mweni kalikala upandi wa ukulu wa Sapanga.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Mliwachili vila yamkola Yesu, vila kafumilila mayeso kuhuma kwa wandu weni sambi, ili mkotoho kutoka kumkwinila Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Pamonga na yiwa mnguyangala kusinda sambi, ila mwambila kutovana mbaka kuyita mwahi. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Ghuli munguisemwa hila milando gha kuwataya moyu yiwa Sapanga anguwakema mwenga ni wana ghaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwana ghangu ukotoho kupughanya mnyokolu wa Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">wala ukotoho kuhuya kuhyetu kuukwinila paakukalipila.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Kwaikiva Bambu anguwanyokola wala wogha anguwapala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">mweni angumkalipila kila mundu mweni kumjumila kuwela mundu ghaki.” <verse eid="HEB 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Mufumilili mnyokolu kwaikiva ni mavulo, kwaikiva Sapanga anguwagholela mwenga handa wana ghaki. Kwaikiva ni mwana ghani kanyokolwa ng'ogha na mlela ghaki? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Sapanga anguwanyokola wana ghaki wogha paikawela Sapanga kawanyokola ng'ogha mmanyi yiwa mwenga ni handa wana wa panje na ng'ogha wana ghaki. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Kupiti hagha, twenga tunguwatundamila walela wa twenga watulelili hata pawatunyokola. Hinu, tungupalwa kumtundamila nesu Tati wa twenga wa kimpumulo ili tupati kulama. <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Watati wa twenga haku kumlimawogha watunyokolili kwa lipindi, handa weni vila walolili yiwa ni maha kutunyokola, ila Sapanga angutunyokola kwaikiva gha fwaida gha twenga weni, ili tupati kukonghanila ku umbuleti pee handa mweni. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Kwahela mundu mweni kuhekelelela mnyokolu ila angunyengemala ila wandu wenikuivula kuwela na ndyangilu maha kwanjila gha kunyokolwa wangulikala kwa umaha na kwa kughola mighalum yenikujumilika kuulongolo gha Sapanga.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo na makaniso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Hinu muyapeghi makakala mawoku gha mwenga yala yapola, na manung'una gha mwenga yeni ulepelelu. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Myendeleli kutyanga kunjila zya maha, ili kila kiwela ng'ogha na makakala kikotoho kubyodoka ila kipati ukomu.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Mgangamali kwa kulikala kula kuvile ng'ogha na matovano na wandu wogha na kulikala kukubaghulwa kwaikiva gha Bambu, kwaikiva kwahela mundu kalikala ng'ogha ngalilu gha kumtundamila Sapanga atewesa kumlola Sapanga. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Mlolesi maha, paghati gha mwenga pakotoho kuwela mundu yeyosi atesindwa umaha wa Sapanga, hata akotoho kuwela handa mkegha wa libiki likalipa na kutipuka na kuhakila watangala kwa sumu ghaki. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Mlikali mihu ili paghati mwa mwenga pakotoho kuwela na mundu mngongola au mundu kamtundamila ng'ogha Sapanga handa Esau, mweni kuwusa uwelekwa ghaki wa mtumbulo kwa mulyo mmonga. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Mwenga mngumanya yiwa kuulongolo, paapalili kulihi hila highili kangi, walemili kumpegha, kwaikiva apatili ng'ogha fwasi gha kuluwa kuleka sambi, pamonga na yiwa ahakulili kwa masosi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Mwenga mhika ng'ogha kulitumbi walikema Sinai, lila linguwesa ng'ogha kukolwa kwa mawoko handa waigholile wa Izilaeli na mhika ng'ogha kulyoto liyaka na kula kweni lwisa, liyegha likalipa, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />lilowi lya lipembi na lilowi lya milando. Wala wayoghanilili lilowi lila waluwili wakotoho kulihyoghanila kangi na wapalili wakotoho kulongelwa kangi, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />kwaikiva wasindilwi kufumilila selia wapeghilwi, “Mweni kuyavisa litumbi hali hata akawela likokolo litetovwa maganga mbaka kuhova.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Mighalu hila iwagholili watili nesu, hata Musa akalonga, “Ningutila na ninguhihimila nesu kwa holu.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ila mwenga mhika kulitumbi Sayuni, Yelusalemu gha kundumba, mlima wa Sapanga avile mkomu, na maielufu gha watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga walikungula, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Mhika kulipinga likulunga lya wawelekwa wa mtumbulo wa Sapanga mahina ghao yayandikwa kundumba, Mngugholoka kuulongolo gha Sapanga avile mlamula wa wogha, na kuulongolo gha mpumulo wa wandu wala maha wavile Sapanga kawaghola wajumiliki kuulongolo ghaki. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Muhika pabehi na Yesu mweni kuwela mghola ndulumu wa wandu na Sapanga kulilaghano lyonu, na kumwahi ghaki iyitwa yenikulonga na twenga milando maha nesu kupiti mwahi gha Abeli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Hinu, mliloli mwa weni ili mkotoho kulema kumyoghanila hayu mweni kuilongela na mwenga. Handa wala walemili kumuyoghanila yula awakanisili haku kumlimawogha walokoka ng'ogha, twenga tutewesa ghuli kulokoka handa tulema kumuyoghanila yula mweni kutukanisa kuhuma kundumba. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Lipindi lya dahile ahihimilisili mlima, ila hinaa ailongile, “Nitehighimilisa mlima na kangi ng'ogha mlima weka itewela pamonga na kundumba hilahila.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Lilando hali livile lingulongelwa kangi, “kwa lihanja lingi kangi” lingulangiha yiwa vindu vyogha alumbile Sapanga haku kumlimawogha vitehhihimila ili vihighali vindu vila vitewesa ng'ogha kuhighimila.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Hinu twenga tungupalwa kushukwile, kwaikiva tungupokela unkosi uwesa ng'ogha kuhihimaliswa. Tuweli na kushukwile na kumtundamila Sapanga kwa njila itemghola ahekeleli, kwa mayupo na holu. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Kwaikiva Sapanga wa twenga chakaka ni lyoto likalipa liwesa lyeni kuyalamisa.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Vila tunguwesa kumuhekelesa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Muyendeleli kupalana handa vila ingupalwa kwa wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Mukotoho kuisemwa kuwakema wahenja pakaya, kwaikiva kwa kughola nagha, amonga gha wandu wapatili kuwakema watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wakiva wamanya ng'ogha. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Mngumbuki wala wawopwa handa na mwenga muwopwa pamonga na weni. Mungumbuki wala wangughasika handa na mwenga mngughasika handa weni.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Ndowa ingupalwa kutundamilwa na wandu wogha, mngwana na mhumbu ghaki wangupalwa kulikinga na ndaka, kwaikiva Sapanga atewalamula wangongola na wala wapala kuwonja na wadala waghangi na walumi waghangi.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Mlikingi kulongoswa na lumatamata lwa kupala mapesa, myukuti na vila mvikola. Mweni Sapanga angulonga, “Katu nitekuleka ng'ogha, hilahila kukutagha.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Kwaikiva gha nagha tunguwesa kulonga kwa uhighilisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">“Bambu ndiwa mtanga wa nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">nitetila ng'ogha chochosi, mundu atewesa kunighola niki?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Mkwimbuki wala vilongosi wa mwenga wawavulile mwenga Lilando lya Sapanga, mloli maha vila walikalili na kuhova. Mukovekeli ukwinila ghao. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu Kilisito ni yula yula, lichu lelo na machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Mkotoho kululunganywa na mavulo gha kihenja. Ni maha mioyu gha mwenga igangamaliswi kwa manemu, ng'ogha kuyitikila makaniso gha milyo, makaniso hagha yangumtanga ng'ogha wala wenikuyakola hagha. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Twenga tuvile na lihanja lya kumuyupa Sapanga na wala wenikumyupa Sapanga kweni luhanja gha kumyupila Sapanga wangupalwa ng'ogha kulyegha vila vivikwa kunani ghaki. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Mtambika Mkulu anguyegha mwahi gha mkokolo mghati mwa mahala Pambuleti Pee kwaikiva gha litambiko lya kulekeselwa sambi, ila higha gha mkokolu yula unguyalamiswa panji gha kambi hila. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Havi ndiwa Yesu ahakiliwi panji gha lilangu lya mlima ili awaghululi wandu kwa mwahi ghaki mweni. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Hinu tuyendi panji gha kambi, tukijumila kupughanywa handa vila apughanyililwi mweni. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Kwaikiva haku kumlimawogha tuvile ng'ogha na mlima wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, ila tunguhakula hula utehika kuulongolo. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Hinu kwa kupitila Yesu, tumyegheli Sapanga litambiku lya kumsifila machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, kwaikiva milando gha twenga gha kulisifila lihina lyaki ni handa litambiku tumtolela. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Hilahila myendeleli kuwatanga wayenu kwa hindu hila muwela nayu kwaikiva kughola nagha ndiwa litambiku lya mwenga lyeni kumhekelesa Sapanga.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Muwatundamili vilongosi wa mwenga na kukola ghala wanguwalongela, kwaikiva weni wangulihumisa kwaikiva gha mwenga bila kutoka, na watepalwa kulongela mahengiu ghao kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa nagha muwatundamili. Ikiva mtewatundamila wateghola mahengu kwa luheku, na ikiva ng'ogha wateghola mahengu kwa kunyengemala, na hai itewela ng'ogha na fwaida kwa mwenga. <verse eid="HEB 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Mtuyupili kwa Sapanga. Kwaikiva mioyu gha twenga ingutulamula ng'ogha yiwa tughola uhakata, kwaikiva tunguyangala kughola maha kwa wandu wogha. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Ninguwapala nesu mniyupili ili Sapanga anihuyisi kwa mwenga kwa kuloposela.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mayupo gha kuyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Sapanga yula amyeghili kangi Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito kuhuma kukihu, yula Mhunga Mkulu wa kondolu, kwaikiva gha kuyita mwahi ghaki yenikulangiha lilaghano lya machuwa hyogha bila mwihu ni lya chakaka, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Sapanga awapeghi makakala gha kughola yala anguyapala kangi agholi kumioyu gha mwenga mighalu hyogha imhekelesa kwa njila gha Yesu Kilisito, mweni asifilwi machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Hina!<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milando gha kuyomolelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Walongu ghangu ninguwaluwa nesu mkovekeli milando hai gha kuwataya moyu yavile niyayandika kulihamba hali kwa kihupi. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Ningupala kuwamanyisa yiwa mlongu wa twenga Timoseyu kawoposelwa kala kuhuma muuwopwa. Ikiva atehika njenji kwa nenga, nitehika na mweni panihika kwa mwenga kuwalola.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Muwajambusi wandu wenikuwagholokela wogha pamonga na wandu wa Sapanga. Wandu wenikumkwinila Yesu haku Italia wanguwajambusa.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Tunguwayupila kwa Sapanga ayendeleli kuwapatila umaha ghaki mwenga wogha.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>